[l_braz_por.industrial_complex]
Fábrica civil

[l_braz_por.industrial_complex_desc]
Esta construção fornece ao estado indústrias para produção de mercadorias civis ou edificação de novas construções. Pode ser convertida em uma indústria militar se necessário.

[l_braz_por.industrial_complex_plural]
Fábricas civis

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
Velocidade de edificação de fábricas civis

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de edificação de fábricas civis.

[l_english.industrial_complex]
Civilian Factory

[l_english.industrial_complex_desc]
This building provides the state with industry for production of civilian goods or construction of new buildings. Can be converted to military industry if needed.

[l_english.industrial_complex_plural]
Civilian Factories

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
§YCivilian Factory§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Civilian Factory.

[l_french.industrial_complex]
Usine civile

[l_french.industrial_complex_desc]
Ce type de bâtiments permet de produire des biens civils ou de construire de nouveaux bâtiments dans cet État. Si nécessaire, il peut être transformé en usine militaire.

[l_french.industrial_complex_plural]
Usines civiles

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
Vitesse de constr. des usines civiles 

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction des usines civiles.

[l_german.industrial_complex]
Zivilfabrik

[l_german.industrial_complex_desc]
Dieses Gebäude ermöglicht der Region die Produktion von Zivilgütern oder den Bau neuer Gebäude. Kann bei Bedarf in eine Militärfabrik umgewandelt werden.

[l_german.industrial_complex_plural]
Zivilfabriken

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit (Zivilfabriken)

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für Zivilfabriken.

[l_japanese.industrial_complex]
民需工場

[l_japanese.industrial_complex_desc]
民生品生産や新しい建物の建設のための工業力を供給する。必要であれば、軍需工場へと転換できる。

[l_japanese.industrial_complex_plural]
民需工場

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
§Y民需工場§!建設速度

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
民需工場建設速度を補正する。

[l_korean.industrial_complex]
민간공장

[l_korean.industrial_complex_desc]
이 건물은 해당 주에 민간 상품을 생산하고 새로운 건물을 짓기 위한 산업력을 제공합니다. 필요한 경우 군수공장으로 전환될 수 있습니다.

[l_korean.industrial_complex_plural]
민간공장

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
§Y민간공장§! 건설 속도

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
민간공장 건설 속도 변동치.

[l_polish.industrial_complex]
Fabryka cywilna

[l_polish.industrial_complex_desc]
Ta fabryka umożliwia produkcję dóbr konsumpcyjnych i wznoszenie nowych budynków w regionie. Może być przekształcona w fabrykę wojskową.

[l_polish.industrial_complex_plural]
Fabryki cywilne

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
Tempo budowy fabryk cywilnych

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
Zmiana tempa budowy fabryk cywilnych.

[l_russian.industrial_complex]
Фабрика

[l_russian.industrial_complex_desc]
Это сооружение снабжает регион товарами народного потребления и позволяет строить новые сооружения. При необходимости его можно превратить в завод по выпуску военной продукции.

[l_russian.industrial_complex_plural]
Фабрики

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
Скорость строительства §Yфабрик§!

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
Изменяет скорость строительства фабрик.

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_complex]
民用工厂

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_complex_desc]
此建筑可为所属地区提供生产民用商品或建造新建筑的工业能力，或可因需转换为军用工厂。

[l_simp_chinese.industrial_complex_plural]
民用工厂

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
§Y民用工厂§!建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
改变民用工厂的建设速度。

[l_spanish.industrial_complex]
Fábrica civil

[l_spanish.industrial_complex_desc]
Este edificio proporciona al estado la industria para la producción de bienes civiles o construcción de nuevos edificios. Se puede convertir a la industria militar si es necesario.

[l_spanish.industrial_complex_plural]
Fábricas civiles

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor]
Velocidad de construcción de §YFábrica civil§!

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_industrial_complex_factor_desc]
Modifica la velocidad de las fábricas civiles.

